  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "@deepwhale-cn/dsh-badge",
      "text": "给用深鲸桌面（DeepWhale Desktop）产出的文档、PR、MR 加「powered by dwh」署名徽章。\n\n格式与官方 `@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-badge` 一致：一个 skill provider 插件，正文在 `assets/deepwhale-badge.md`，资源目录 `assets/`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add @deepwhale-cn/dsh-badge\n```\n\n或手动在组合里插一行：\n\n```yaml\n- insert:\n    - id: deepwhale-badge\n      name: '@deepwhale-cn/dsh-badge'\n```\n\n装好后会话的 skill 目录里会出现 `deepwhale-badge`，模型在产出内容时可以按它的说明加徽章。"
    },
    {
      "section": "内容",
      "text": "- `assets/deepwhale-badge.md`：徽章用法（Markdown 片段、尺寸、摆放规则、免责说明）\n- `assets/deepwhale-badge.png`：726×120 源图，按 121×20 显示（胶囊圆角、透明背景）"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "MIT。徽章只表示「内容用深鲸桌面生成」，不代表 DeepSeek 官方或深鲸官方背书。"
    }
  ],
